    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>resinous matter dissolved in some liquid and used for spreading over a surface to give it a hard, shining, transparent coat (OED s.v. varnish n.1 1a, MED s.v. vernish n.) | meaning unknown | for use as a topical medication (MED s.v. vernish n.)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
    <crm:P2_has_type rdf:resource="http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"/>
